<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Friday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,560.90 (1,565.50)	CHF  1,062.70 (1,061.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    910.15 (911.18)	  GBP  2,529.40 (2,539.20)</p>
<p>    ATS    129.34 (129.47)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $26.11 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $15.42 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $41.53 million ($79.91 million) -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
